  "- A user message may end with a note about earlier proposals (applied, rejected or skipped). Trust it over your memory.",
  "- You cannot run commands.",
]
`;

exports[`edit wording contracts > pins every review tool description 1`] = `
{
  "delete": "Propose deleting a file. The deletion is only proposed: the file stays on disk until the user reviews and applies it in OpenVern. The path is relative to the project root.",
  "edit": "Propose a change to an existing text file by replacing an exact string. old_string must match the file exactly (whitespace and indentation included) and be unique in the file, unless replace_all is true. Include enough surrounding lines to make it unique. Read the file first. Prefer this over write_file for small and medium changes. The change is only proposed: nothing is written until the user reviews and applies it in OpenVern. Later reads show your proposed version. The path is relative to the project root.",
  "write": "Propose creating a new text file, or replacing the whole content of an existing one. Use it for new files, or when most of a file changes; use edit_file for targeted changes. content is the complete file. The change is only proposed: nothing is written until the user reviews and applies it in OpenVern. Later reads show your proposed version. The path is relative to the project root; missing folders are created on apply.",
}
`;

